@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+= new-window-or-open(1)
+
+== Name
+
+new-window-or-open - trigger a menu item for a running app or launch the app if it is not running
+
+== Synopsis
+
+`aerospace new-window-or-open <app-name>`
+
+== Description
+
+If the target app is already running, open a new window by clicking the first File menu item containing "New".
+If the app is not running, launch it by app name and return.
